# One folder per POC, named by its POC Studio row id. Only each folder's studio/ is kept:
# Nebula's own folders (.nebula, .sessions, specs, plans, docs, records, entities,
# entity-manifests, CLAUDE.md, memory.md) rebuild from the tenant on every run, and a
# code app checkout (<appId>/) is a git repository of its own whose source Code Builder keeps.
/*/*
!/*/studio/
